                                "sense_id": "55260e90-ece5-31ee-beca-3758bf79c648",
                                "text": "Nevertheless the Austrian Kaiser answers that his German Princes, for their part, cannot be unfeudalised; that they have Possessions in French Alsace, and Feudal Rights secured to them, for which no conceivable compensation will suffice."
